= A rightward turn?

Following deep political instability produced by the failure of the Sejm to build a stable governing majority[? if president != 'Wojciechowski' and president != "Zamoyski" : and the result of the presidential election. ?]

The parties will meet in Warsaw to discuss how to approach the current problems plaguing **<span style="color: #CCC;">Pol</span><span style="color: #DC143C;">and</span>**.

- @discuss: The parties discuss...

@discuss
go-to: lanckorona_pact if psl_p_right >= (psl_p_left + (psl_p_relation*(4/100)))

The PSL-P discusses

- @compromise: The ChZJN attempts to compromise with the PSL-P

@compromise

higher tariffs err more agricultural policy etc.

To do: Parcellation/Expropriation

- @result: The result?

@result

After careful diplomatic exchange

- @deal: The PSL-P agrees.
- @nodeal: Ths PSL-P refuses.

@deal
view-if: psl_p_right >= (psl_p_left + (psl_p_relation*(3/100)))
go-to: lanckorona_pact

@nodeal
view-if: psl_p_right < (psl_p_left + (psl_p_relation*(3/100)))
on-arrival: psl_p_left += 2

Ah Shucks

@lanckorona_pact
on-arrival: lanckorona_pact = 1; psl_p_ideology = 'Right'; psl_p_left -= 2; psl_p_relation -= 25; peasants_psl_p += 5

The two parties have reached an agreement, they will both pursue a formation of a parliamentary majority.

The agreement stipulated that numerus clausus should be applied in education, agricultural expropriation will be accelerated at least 200,000 hectares per year, there will be increased **<span style="color: #CCC;">Poloni</span><span style="color: #DC143C;">zation</span>** of the Eastern Borderlands and other right wing reforms.

This represents the signifact and irreversible shift of the PSL-P to the right.
